CHD_250314_21.jpg An interior view of a modern container-style house with dimensions: Width 6 meters, Depth 2.4 meters, Height 2.4 meters. The interior combines raw, industrial aesthetics with natural elements. The front wall features a large window and a central door allowing natural light inside. The walls have a mix of weathered rock textures and exposed concrete, creating a rugged yet elegant atmosphere. The floor is polished concrete, and the ceiling incorporates wooden beams for warmth. The space is minimalistic, with functional furniture, including a small seating area, a compact kitchenette, and built-in storage. The interior design emphasizes a cozy yet modern living environment, seamlessly blending with its natural surroundings.
